title: Both type, break lines and delete at the same place as fast as they can, saving in the middle: nothing outside that place changes (compare the guest's file with the host's by hand)
folders: share-text
limit: 75
expect-log: saved .*notes\.txt
expect-file: share-text\notes.txt :: ^line 01\nline 02\nline 03\nline 04\nline 05\nline 06[HGhg\n]*\nline 07\nline 08\nline 09\nline 10\nline 11\nline 12\n$

wait 3000
share start writers
wait 9000
edit notes.txt 6 1
key end
wait 1500
type H
key enter
type h
key backspace
wait 60
